@*
    MineForTheOnePiece.razor
    A dig-down mining game modeled on the feel of Motherload (XGen, 2004),
    built from scratch for this app with its own procedural world and
    pirate/treasure-hunt flavor rather than any borrowed code or art.

    What makes it play like Motherload:
      - Free 2D movement with momentum: gravity always pulls, holding Up
        fires the thruster (the Engine upgrade sets how hard it fights
        gravity, and a full cargo hold makes it sluggish), and the pod
        slides/drifts rather than stepping tile by tile.
      - Drilling only goes Down, Left or Right - never Up - and sideways
        drilling needs the pod resting on the ground. The only way home is
        flying back up shafts you've already dug, so every dive is a little
        route-planning puzzle.
      - Fuel drains constantly while underground (more when thrusting or
        drilling); falls hurt based on impact speed; heat builds with depth.
      - Nothing at the surface is free (except on Easy): four stations sell
        fuel, buy ore, sell upgrades/supplies, and repair the hull.
      - Steep ore-value curve, consumable items (fuel can, repair kit,
        powder kegs to blast boulders, Den Den Mushi recall), and pirate
        radio calls with gold bonuses at depth milestones.

    Ideas borrowed from Miner Depths (a modern Motherload-like): a saved
    expedition checkpointed at every dock, a touch joystick, buried
    crates, loose rock that wobbles and then falls (cave-ins), a guided
    "Anchor Drop" descent item, and pod paint jobs kept across runs.

    Kid-friendly change from the original: running dry or wrecking the hull
    doesn't end the run - the crew tows you home, you lose your cargo and
    pay a small tow fee. The run ends when the legendary treasure at the
    bottom is dug out (or the player exits).

    Same fixed-timestep loop shape as SpaceGame/AirHockey: a Task.Delay
    frame loop with a capped substep count so a backgrounded tab can't
    simulate a huge jump (and tunnel the pod through a floor).

    World layout: column 0 is the leftmost lane; rows SkyTop..0 are open
    air above the surface (the stations sit on row 0), rows 1..TotalDepthRows
    are the mine. The pod is a 0.8-tile square tracked in tile units.

    Usage:
        <MineForTheOnePiece OnComplete="HandleGameComplete" />
*@
@implements IAsyncDisposable
@inject InteropService Interop
@inject AppDataService Data

<div class="mo-game">

    @if (phase == Phase.Setup)
    {
        <div class="mo-setup game-setup-panel">
            <div class="mo-hero" aria-hidden="true">
                <img class="mo-hero-anchor" src="images/mining/anchor.png" alt="" />
                <img class="mo-hero-pod @PaintClass" src="images/mining/pod.png" alt="" style="@PaintStyle" />
                <img class="mo-hero-treasure" src="images/mining/treasure.png" alt="" />
                <span class="mo-hero-caption">THE DEEP IS CALLING</span>
            </div>
            <h2>🏴‍☠️ Mine for the One Piece</h2>
            <p>Fly your drill pod deep under the island in search of treasure - and the legendary One Piece itself. Hold ⬆️ to fly, and drill ⬇️ ⬅️ ➡️ (you can't drill up, so keep a way home!). Sell your haul at the Treasure Trader, then refuel, repair, and upgrade before diving again. Your expedition saves every time you dock, so you can keep digging another day.</p>

            <h3 class="game-section-title">Choose a difficulty</h3>
            @if (LockedDifficulty is { } locked)
            {
                <p class="game-choice-locked">🔒 A parent set this to <strong>@DifficultyName(locked)</strong> (@DifficultyDetail(locked)).</p>
            }
            else
            {
                <div class="game-option-grid">
                    @foreach (var diff in Difficulties)
                    {
                        <button class="game-option-button @(diff == selectedDifficulty ? "selected" : "")" @onclick="() => selectedDifficulty = diff">
                            <span class="mo-diff-name">@DifficultyName(diff)</span>
                            <span class="mo-diff-detail">@DifficultyDetail(diff)</span>
                        </button>
                    }
                </div>
            }

            @if (ContinuableSave is { } save)
            {
                <div class="mo-continue">
                    <button class="game-primary-action" @onclick="ContinueGame">💾 Continue expedition</button>
                    <span class="mo-continue-detail">@save.Difficulty · deepest @(save.DeepestRow * 10)m · 💰@save.Gold</span>
                    <button class="game-secondary-action" @onclick="StartGame">New expedition</button>
                    <span class="mo-continue-detail">Starting new replaces your saved expedition.</span>
                </div>
            }
            else
            {
                <button class="game-primary-action" @onclick="StartGame">Set Sail</button>
            }
        </div>
    }
    else
    {
        <div class="game-hud mo-hud">
            <span class="mo-title">⛏️ Mine for the One Piece</span>
            <span class="game-stat">📏 @(PodRow * 10)m</span>
            <span class="game-stat">💰 @gold</span>
            <div class="mo-bar @(FuelPct < 25 ? "mo-bar-low" : "")" title="Fuel">
                <div class="mo-bar-fill mo-fuel-fill" style="width:@(FuelPct.ToString("0.#", Inv))%;"></div>
                <span class="mo-bar-label">⛽ @((int)Math.Ceiling(fuel))/@FuelCapacity(fuelTankTier)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mo-bar @(HullPct < 25 ? "mo-bar-low" : "")" title="Hull">
                <div class="mo-bar-fill mo-hull-fill" style="width:@(HullPct.ToString("0.#", Inv))%;"></div>
                <span class="mo-bar-label">🛡️ @((int)Math.Ceiling(hull))/@HullMax(hullTier)</span>
            </div>
            <span class="game-stat @(CargoCount >= CargoCapacity(cargoTier) ? "mo-stat-full" : "")">🎒 @CargoCount/@CargoCapacity(cargoTier)</span>
            @if (HeatDamagePerSecond > 0)
            {
                <span class="game-stat mo-stat-hot" title="Heat is damaging your hull - upgrade the Radiator">🌡️ Hot!</span>
            }
            <button class="game-secondary-action" @onclick="ExitToSetup">← Exit</button>
        </div>

        <div class="mo-expedition"><span>@DepthZone</span><span>Deepest: @(deepestRow * 10)m</span></div>

        <div class="mo-play">
        <div class="mo-left">
            <div class="mo-items">
                @for (var i = 0; i < ItemKinds.Length; i++)
                {
                    var item = ItemKinds[i];
                    var count = items.GetValueOrDefault(item);
                    var hotkey = i + 1;
                    <button class="mo-item-btn" disabled="@(count == 0 || !CanUseItem(item))" title="@ItemName(item) (key @hotkey)"
                            @onclick="() => UseItem(item)">
                        <span class="mo-item-icon">@ItemIcon(item)</span>
                        <span class="mo-item-name">@ItemName(item)</span>
                        <span class="mo-item-count">@count</span>
                        <span class="mo-item-key">@hotkey</span>
                    </button>
                }
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mo-center" @ref="boxRef">
        <div class="mo-stage" style="@StageStyle">
            <div class="mo-field @(DateTime.UtcNow < shakeUntilUtc ? "mo-shake" : "")" @ref="fieldRef" tabindex="0"
                 aria-label="Mining field. Hold Up to fly, Down, Left or Right to drill. Number keys 1 to 6 use items."
                 @onkeydown="OnKeyDown" @onkeydown:preventDefault="true" @onkeyup="OnKeyUp" @onblur="() => heldKeys.Clear()">

                <div class="mo-world" style="transform:translate(@Pct(-camX, visibleCols)%, @Pct(-(camY - SkyTop), visibleRows)%);">
                    <div class="mo-sky" style="left:0; top:0; width:@Pct(Cols, visibleCols)%; height:@Pct(1 - SkyTop, visibleRows)%;"></div>
                    <div class="mo-underground" style="left:0; top:@Pct(1 - SkyTop, visibleRows)%; width:@Pct(Cols, visibleCols)%; height:@Pct(TotalDepthRows, visibleRows)%;"></div>

                    @foreach (var st in Stations)
                    {
                        <div class="mo-station mo-station-@st.Kind.ToString().ToLowerInvariant() @(StationAtPod() == st.Kind ? "mo-station-near" : "")"
                             style="left:@Pct(st.Col + 0.08, visibleCols)%; top:@Pct(-1 - SkyTop, visibleRows)%; width:@Pct(StationWidth - 0.16, visibleCols)%; height:@Pct(2, visibleRows)%;">
                            <span class="mo-station-sign">@st.Emoji</span>
                            <span class="mo-station-name">@st.Name</span>
                            <span class="mo-station-door"></span>
                        </div>
                    }

                    @for (var r = Math.Max(1, (int)Math.Floor(camY)); r <= Math.Min(TotalDepthRows, (int)Math.Floor(camY) + visibleRows); r++)
                    {
                        for (var c = Math.Max(0, (int)Math.Floor(camX)); c <= Math.Min(Cols - 1, (int)Math.Floor(camX) + visibleCols); c++)
                        {
                            var kind = tiles[r, c];
                            if (kind == TileKind.Empty) continue;
                            var shown = DisplayKind(kind, r, c);
                            var isDrill = drilling && drillRow == r && drillCol == c;
                            var wobbling = kind == TileKind.LooseRock && wobblingRocks.ContainsKey((r, c));

                            <div class="mo-cell @(TileClass(shown)) @(isDrill ? "digging" : "") @(wobbling ? "mo-wobble" : "")"
                                 title="@TileLabel(shown)"
                                 style="@CellStyle(r, c, isDrill)">
                                @if (TileAsset(shown) is { } asset)
                                {
                                    <img class="mo-tile-art" src="@asset" alt="@TileLabel(shown)" draggable="false" />
                                }
                                else if (TileGlyph(shown) is { } glyph)
                                {
                                    <span class="mo-tile-glyph">@glyph</span>
                                }
                            </div>
                        }
                    }

                    @foreach (var rock in fallingRocks)
                    {
                        <div class="mo-cell mo-tile-looserock mo-falling-rock"
                             style="left:@Pct(rock.Col, visibleCols)%; top:@Pct(rock.Y - SkyTop, visibleRows)%; width:@Pct(1, visibleCols)%; height:@Pct(1, visibleRows)%;">
                        </div>
                    }

                    <div class="mo-pod mo-facing-@(facing.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()) @(thrusting ? "mo-pod-thrusting" : "") @(drilling ? "mo-pod-drilling" : "") @(anchorActive ? "mo-pod-anchored" : "")"
                         style="left:@Pct(px, visibleCols)%; top:@Pct(py - SkyTop, visibleRows)%; width:@Pct(PodHalf * 2 * 1.1, visibleCols)%;">
                        <div class="mo-pod-thrust"></div>
                        <img class="mo-pod-art @PaintClass" src="images/mining/pod.png" alt="Your mining pod" draggable="false" style="@PaintStyle" />
                    </div>
                </div>

                @if (radioMessage is not null)
                {
                    <div class="mo-radio" role="status">
                        <span class="mo-radio-icon">🐌📡</span>
                        <span>@radioMessage</span>
                    </div>
                }
            </div>

            @if (overlay == Overlay.Station && activeStation is { } station)
            {
                <div class="mo-panel-backdrop">
                    <div class="mo-panel mo-panel-@station.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()" role="dialog" aria-label="@StationName(station)">
                        <h3 class="game-section-title">@StationEmoji(station) @StationName(station)</h3>
                        @switch (station)
                        {
                            case Station.Fuel:
                                <p class="mo-panel-line">Tank: <strong>@((int)Math.Ceiling(fuel)) / @FuelCapacity(fuelTankTier)</strong></p>
                                <p class="mo-panel-hint">@(FuelPrice <= 0 ? "Fuel is free on Easy!" : $"💰{FuelPrice.ToString("0.##", Inv)} per unit")</p>
                                <button class="game-primary-action" disabled="@(fuel >= FuelCapacity(fuelTankTier))" @onclick="Refuel">
                                    @(fuel >= FuelCapacity(fuelTankTier) ? "Tank is full" : RefuelCost <= gold ? $"Fill up - 💰{RefuelCost}" : $"Buy what you can - 💰{gold}")
                                </button>
                                break;

                            case Station.Repair:
                                <p class="mo-panel-line">Hull: <strong>@((int)Math.Ceiling(hull)) / @HullMax(hullTier)</strong></p>
                                <p class="mo-panel-hint">@(RepairPrice <= 0 ? "Repairs are free on Easy!" : $"💰{RepairPrice.ToString("0.##", Inv)} per point")</p>
                                <button class="game-primary-action" disabled="@(hull >= HullMax(hullTier))" @onclick="Repair">
                                    @(hull >= HullMax(hullTier) ? "Hull is in top shape" : RepairCost <= gold ? $"Repair fully - 💰{RepairCost}" : $"Repair what you can - 💰{gold}")
                                </button>
                                break;

                            case Station.Trader:
                                if (cargo.Count == 0)
                                {
                                    <p class="mo-panel-hint">Your cargo hold is empty. Go dig up some treasure!</p>
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                    <div class="mo-cargo-list">
                                        @foreach (var kv in cargo.OrderBy(kv => OreValue(kv.Key)))
                                        {
                                            <div class="mo-cargo-row">
                                                <img src="@TileAsset(kv.Key)" alt="" class="mo-cargo-icon mo-tile-@kv.Key.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()" />
                                                <span>@TileLabel(kv.Key) × @kv.Value</span>
                                                <span class="mo-cargo-value">💰@(kv.Value * OreValue(kv.Key))</span>
                                            </div>
                                        }
                                    </div>
                                    <button class="game-primary-action" @onclick="SellAll">Sell everything - 💰@CargoValue</button>
                                }
                                break;

                            case Station.Shipwright:
                                <p class="mo-panel-hint">💰 @gold gold</p>
                                <div class="mo-tabs" role="tablist">
                                    @foreach (var tab in ShipTabs)
                                    {
                                        <button class="mo-tab @(shipTab == tab ? "selected" : "")" role="tab" aria-selected="@(shipTab == tab)" @onclick="() => shipTab = tab">@ShipTabName(tab)</button>
                                    }
                                </div>
                                if (shipTab == ShipTab.Upgrades)
                                {
                                <div class="mo-shop-grid">
                                    @foreach (var kind in ShopKinds)
                                    {
                                        var tier = TierOf(kind);
                                        var maxed = tier >= MaxTier;
                                        var cost = maxed ? 0 : UpgradeCost(tier);

                                        <div class="mo-shop-card @ShopClass(kind)">
                                            <span class="mo-shop-icon">@ShopIcon(kind)</span>
                                            <span class="mo-shop-name">@ShopName(kind)</span>
                                            <span class="mo-shop-tier">Tier @tier@(maxed ? " (Max)" : $" → {tier + 1}")</span>
                                            <span class="mo-shop-stat">@ShopStat(kind, tier, maxed)</span>
                                            @if (!maxed)
                                            {
                                                <button class="game-primary-action mo-shop-buy" disabled="@(gold < cost)" @onclick="() => BuyUpgrade(kind)">💰@cost</button>
                                            }
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                </div>
                                }
                                else if (shipTab == ShipTab.Supplies)
                                {
                                <div class="mo-shop-grid">
                                    @foreach (var item in ItemKinds)
                                    {
                                        var count = items.GetValueOrDefault(item);
                                        <div class="mo-shop-card mo-shop-item">
                                            <span class="mo-shop-icon">@ItemIcon(item)</span>
                                            <span class="mo-shop-name">@ItemName(item)</span>
                                            <span class="mo-shop-stat">@ItemDescription(item)</span>
                                            <span class="mo-shop-tier">Have @count/@MaxItemCount</span>
                                            <button class="game-primary-action mo-shop-buy" disabled="@(gold < ItemCost(item) || count >= MaxItemCount)" @onclick="() => BuyItem(item)">💰@ItemCost(item)</button>
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                </div>
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                <p class="mo-panel-hint">Paint jobs are yours to keep on every expedition.</p>
                                <div class="mo-shop-grid">
                                    @foreach (var paint in Paints)
                                    {
                                        var owned = OwnsPaint(paint.Id);
                                        var equipped = mineProfile.SelectedPaint == paint.Id;
                                        <div class="mo-shop-card mo-shop-paint @(equipped ? "equipped" : "")">
                                            <img class="mo-paint-preview @PaintClassFor(paint.Id)" src="images/mining/pod.png" alt="" style="@PaintStyleFor(paint.Id)" />
                                            <span class="mo-shop-name">@paint.Name</span>
                                            @if (equipped)
                                            {
                                                <span class="mo-shop-tier">✓ Equipped</span>
                                            }
                                            else if (owned)
                                            {
                                                <button class="game-secondary-action mo-shop-buy" @onclick="() => EquipPaint(paint.Id)">Equip</button>
                                            }
                                            else if (paint.Unlock is { } unlock)
                                            {
                                                <span class="mo-shop-stat">🔒 @unlock</span>
                                            }
                                            else
                                            {
                                                <button class="game-primary-action mo-shop-buy" disabled="@(gold < paint.Cost)" @onclick="() => BuyPaint(paint.Id)">💰@paint.Cost</button>
                                            }
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                </div>
                                }
                                break;
                        }
                        <button class="game-secondary-action mo-panel-leave" @onclick="CloseOverlay">Leave ➜</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            }
            else if (overlay == Overlay.Rescue)
            {
                <div class="mo-panel-backdrop">
                    <div class="mo-panel mo-panel-rescue" role="alertdialog">
                        <h3 class="game-section-title">@rescueTitle</h3>
                        <p class="mo-panel-line">@rescueText</p>
                        <button class="game-primary-action" @onclick="CloseOverlay">Back to work!</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            }
        </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mo-right">
        <div class="mo-message" role="status" aria-live="polite">
            @if (toast is not null)
            {
                <div class="mo-toast">@toast</div>
            }
            else
            {
                <span>@Hint</span>
            }
        </div>

            @if (!mineProfile.UseButtons)
            {
                <div class="mo-stick" @ref="stickRef" aria-label="Joystick: push up to fly, sideways to drive, down to drill"
                     @onpointerdown="OnStickDown" @onpointerdown:preventDefault="true" @onpointermove="OnStickMove"
                     @onpointerup="OnStickUp" @onpointercancel="OnStickUp">
                    <div class="mo-stick-knob" style="transform:translate(-50%, -50%) translate(@((stickX * 80).ToString("0.#", Inv))%, @((stickY * 80).ToString("0.#", Inv))%);"></div>
                </div>
            }
            else
            {
            <div class="mo-dpad">
                <button class="mo-dpad-btn mo-dpad-up" aria-label="Fly up"
                        @onpointerdown="() => SetHeld(Direction.Up)" @onpointerup="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Up)"
                        @onpointercancel="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Up)" @onpointerleave="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Up)">⬆️</button>
                <button class="mo-dpad-btn mo-dpad-left" aria-label="Left"
                        @onpointerdown="() => SetHeld(Direction.Left)" @onpointerup="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Left)"
                        @onpointercancel="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Left)" @onpointerleave="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Left)">⬅️</button>
                <button class="mo-dpad-btn mo-dpad-down" aria-label="Drill down"
                        @onpointerdown="() => SetHeld(Direction.Down)" @onpointerup="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Down)"
                        @onpointercancel="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Down)" @onpointerleave="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Down)">⬇️</button>
                <button class="mo-dpad-btn mo-dpad-right" aria-label="Right"
                        @onpointerdown="() => SetHeld(Direction.Right)" @onpointerup="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Right)"
                        @onpointercancel="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Right)" @onpointerleave="() => ClearHeld(Direction.Right)">➡️</button>
            </div>
            }

            <button class="mo-control-toggle" @onclick="ToggleControls" title="Switch touch controls">
                @(mineProfile.UseButtons ? "🕹️ Use joystick" : "✚ Use buttons")
            </button>
        </div>
        </div>

        @if (phase == Phase.Finished)
        {
            <div class="game-result-overlay">
                <div class="game-result-panel">
                    <h2>🏆 You Found the One Piece!</h2>
                    <p>@(NameOrDefault())dug up the legendary treasure itself! An incredible @(deepestRow * 10)m dive.</p>
                    <div class="game-result-stats">
                        <div><span class="game-stat-label">Depth</span><span class="game-stat-value">@(deepestRow * 10)m</span></div>
                        <div><span class="game-stat-label">Gold</span><span class="game-stat-value">@gold</span></div>
                        <div><span class="game-stat-label">Time</span><span class="game-stat-value">@FormatTime(elapsedSeconds)</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <PersonalBestBadge Value="@(bestDepth is { } bd ? $"{bd * 10}m deep" : null)" IsNew="isNewBest" />
                    <div class="game-result-actions">
                        <button class="game-primary-action" @onclick="StartGame">Play Again</button>
                        <button class="game-secondary-action" @onclick="ExitToSetup">Exit</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        }
    }

</div>

@code {
    private static readonly System.Globalization.CultureInfo Inv = System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture;

    [Parameter] public string? PlayerName { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback<MineForTheOnePieceResult> OnComplete { get; set; }

    /// <summary>Current kid profile's id, for the personal-best record
    /// (deepest depth reached, per difficulty) - null skips recording/display.</summary>
    [Parameter] public string? ProfileId { get; set; }

    /// <summary>A parent-locked difficulty name ("Easy"/"Medium"/"Hard")
    /// from the admin panel; when set, the picker is replaced with a
    /// locked note and that difficulty is used.</summary>
    [Parameter] public string? ForcedDifficulty { get; set; }

    private enum Phase { Setup, Playing, Finished }
    private enum Difficulty { Easy, Medium, Hard }
    private enum Direction { Up, Down, Left, Right }
    private enum Overlay { None, Station, Rescue }
    private enum Station { Fuel, Trader, Shipwright, Repair }
    private enum UpgradeKind { Drill, Engine, FuelTank, CargoHold, Hull, Radiator }
    private enum ItemKind { FuelCan, RepairKit, PowderKeg, BigKeg, AnchorDrop, Recall }
    private enum ShipTab { Upgrades, Supplies, Paint }

    // Saved worlds store each tile as (char)('A' + kind), so new kinds
    // must only ever be appended to the end of this enum.
    private enum TileKind { Empty, Dirt, Stone, HardRock, DenseRock, Bedrock, Copper, Silver, Gold, Emerald, Ruby, Diamond, Relic, Lava, Gas, Boulder, Treasure, Crate, LooseRock }

    private sealed class FallingRock
    {
        public int Col;
        public double Y;
        public double Vy;
    }

    private sealed record StickRect(double Left, double Top, double Width, double Height);

    private sealed record Paint(string Id, string Name, int Cost, string Filter, string? Unlock = null);

    // World
    private const int Cols = 24;
    private const int CenterCol = Cols / 2;
    private const int TotalDepthRows = 120;
    private const int SkyTop = -2;
    // The visible window (in tiles) and on-screen tile size are picked to
    // fill whatever space the play area has - see MeasurePlayArea.
    private int visibleCols = 11;
    private int visibleRows = 13;
    private double tilePx = 48;
    private const double StartX = CenterCol + 0.5;
    private const int StationWidth = 2;

    // Loop
    private const int FrameDelayMs = 16;
    private const double FixedDt = 1.0 / 60.0;
    private const int MaxSubstepsPerFrame = 5;

    // Pod physics (tile units, seconds)
    private const double PodHalf = 0.4;
    private const double Eps = 1e-4;
    private const double Gravity = 14;
    private const double GroundAccel = 22;
    private const double AirAccel = 12;
    private const double GroundFriction = 26;
    private const double AirDrag = 3;
    private const double MaxFallSpeed = 15;
    private const double SafeImpactSpeed = 8.5;
    private const double ImpactDamagePerSpeed = 5;
    private const double StationEnterSpeed = 0.8;

    // Fuel drain per second while underground
    private const double IdleDrain = 0.5;
    private const double MoveDrain = 0.6;
    private const double ThrustDrain = 1.8;
    private const double DrillDrain = 2.2;

    // Loose rock: how long it wobbles (the warning) before dropping, and
    // how much a direct hit hurts.
    private const double WobbleSeconds = 0.8;
    private const double RockHitDamage = 18;

    // Anchor Drop: a guided straight-down dig - fast, no fall damage,
    // hazards along the way are defused.
    private const int AnchorDropTiles = 10;
    private const double AnchorStepSeconds = 0.14;

    private const int SaveVersion = 1;
    private const int MaxTier = 6;
    private const int MaxItemCount = 5;
    private const double ToastSeconds = 2.2;
    private const double RadioSeconds = 6;

    private static readonly Difficulty[] Difficulties = { Difficulty.Easy, Difficulty.Medium, Difficulty.Hard };
    private static readonly UpgradeKind[] ShopKinds = { UpgradeKind.Drill, UpgradeKind.Engine, UpgradeKind.FuelTank, UpgradeKind.CargoHold, UpgradeKind.Hull, UpgradeKind.Radiator };
